SUMMARY:Devil's Foot B Corp Celebration
DESCRIPTION:Join us at The Mule on October 8th as we celebrate a big milestone\, Devil’s Foot Beverage Co. is officially B Corp Certified!\nIt’s more than a little certification\, it’s a promise to do business in a way that’s good for people\, community\, and planet. And we’re marking the occasion the best way we know how\, with good beer\, good music\, and good company. \nWe’ll be pouring some of our favorite fellow B Corp breweries\, New Belgium\, Lawson’s Finest Liquids\, Allagash\, North Coast\, and more! \nThe Asheville Beer Choir will be on-site bringing the joyful noise\, and we’re inviting local B Corp businesses to join the celebration too\, because this milestone belongs to the whole community that helped us get here. \nWhether you’re a longtime Devil’s Foot drinker\, a fellow B Corp business\, or just curious what all this “certified good” business is about\, come raise a glass with us.
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/devils-foot-b-corp-celebration/
CATEGORIES:Family Friendly,Free & Fun!,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/Devils-Foot-B-Corp-Celebration.jpg?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=af61538d63b5533be27cf0bbe65d8485
END:VEVENT
