SUMMARY:Bears Den: Chicago Bears Watch Party
DESCRIPTION:It’s the Crosstown Showdown for Bears @ Packers!\nThat’s right\, Chicago fans! We’re playfully teaming up with our friends at Foggy Mountain to show those Cheeseheads what true fandom looks like 😉 \nFans of the Bears\, come our way to be surrounded by fellow Shuffle enthusiasts. Packers fans\, head to Foggy Mountain and enjoy whatever it is you guys do (and\, admittedly\, the best wings in town). \nWe’ll both run raffles giving fans of each team a chance to win a gift card to either The Mule or Foggy Mountain – all depends on who takes the game! \nDrink specials. Food truck. Football on the big screen. Bear Down. \n 
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/bears-den-chicago-bears-watch-party/
CATEGORIES:Free & Fun!
